21. Icone degli upgrade

Le icone UI devono essere più semplici degli sprite.

HP

Create a minimalist UI icon for the AscendKeep permanent HP upgrade.

Design:

compact ancient stone wall symbol;
small cyan rune at the center;
thick readable silhouette;
muted stone gray and cyan;
no heart symbol;
no text;
transparent background;
designed for a 64×64 mobile interface icon.

Use the same dark fantasy visual language as the AscendKeep tower, but simplify all details.

