22. Icone HUD

Serviranno almeno:

Soul;
wave;
HP;
Voidborn eliminati;
pausa;
velocità di gioco;
impostazioni;
audio;
musica;
restart.

Per mantenere lo stile, usa questo template:

Create a minimalist AscendKeep mobile UI icon representing: [ICON FUNCTION].

Visual language:

simplified dark fantasy arcane symbol;
strong silhouette;
maximum three main shapes;
muted stone gray;
cyan accent;
muted gold only for important interactive elements;
no gradients that disappear at small size;
no text;
no frame;
no circular button background;
transparent background;
designed to remain clear at 32×32 pixels.

The icon must belong to the same visual family as all AscendKeep interface icons.

